  "prefLabel": "Ins 312.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 312.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish standards for the disclosures required to be issued by life insurers pursuant to RSA 408-D:8.\n\nSource. #9937, eff 6-6-11; ss by #12772, eff 6-6-19",
